WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.399
Film Courage: We often hear it's impossible
to get a screenplay read and especially now

00:00:03.399 --> 00:00:08.870
so many new writers want to get in to Netflix,
want to get a meeting with someone. Is it

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:13.820
impossible? Gary W. Goldstein, Producer/Author/Instructor:
No, it's not impossible but I think you have

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:20.980
to calibrate, you have to be realistic. I
mean people talk about Netflix a lot, certainly

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:27.051
it's the big line in the jungle and we see
a lot of good projects being produced are

00:00:27.051 --> 00:00:34.360
required so that's great. Netflix is actually
one of the companies being as big as they

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:38.610
are it's understandable they're a company
who basically advertises they have a policy

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:44.580
that we if we don't have an existing relationship
with you, don't knock on our door. So it would

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:53.420
seem logical that people would have this feeling
like Oh I can't get read but there's but it's

00:00:53.420 --> 00:01:00.170
really not what it seems what they're really
saying is invest a little time make yourself

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:06.210
known to us how do you do that um when the
case first of all there's there's there's

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:12.470
a couple of dozen very vibrant streamers not
just netflix they're not the world of streaming

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:19.740
they're one of the biggest of and there's
a lot of places that you can go who don't

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:23.810
have you know the policy of we don't accept
unsolicited material or you can't come pitch

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:29.530
us whatever it might be but if you really
want to get in the door it reminds me of you

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:35.320
know back in the day when carlos antenna wanted
to play at fillmore west up in san francisco

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:40.670
and bill graham the empresario was like i
don't know who this kid is and he you know

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:45.200
people you knock and you knock and you knock
it's like jeffrey castenberg always used to

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.711
say if if you can't get in the front door
go through the back door if you get in the

00:01:48.711 --> 00:01:53.310
back door climb through a window if you can't
go in through the basement there's a way in

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:58.570
and that's true well carlos santana climbed
up a drainpipe on the exterior of the building

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:03.880
to the third floor and fell through the window
into bill graham's office that's how they

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:11.030
met well i don't recommend that necessarily
but it worked it started his career by the

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:16.010
same token if you want to get into netflix
how hard is it to research who are all the

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:23.400
people who've either produced for them an
original or had a film acquired by them and

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:29.820
cozy up to them this is a team sport this
is it takes a village to get any project made

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:35.720
series feature limited series docu-series
whatever so you're going to want to be knowing

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:39.310
these people regardless well why don't you
just find the ones who are doing the kinds

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:45.880
of projects genre budget that are similar
to yours who happen to have that relationship

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:54.020
and go that route there's a lot of ways in
but there's the other and and the other way

00:02:54.020 --> 00:03:02.550
is there are a lot of people who work at netflix
befriend them

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:08.870
it's not all this is not a like a pass fail
report card or menu of options it's a human

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:14.080
reality if you really are determined to get
into netflix there are people at all levels

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:19.020
from from assistant all the way up uh where
you can identify them and you can find them

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:24.590
on linkedin they're they're named and you
can reach out to them and you can do what

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:31.060
we were just talking about a moment ago which
is introduce yourself but not to say i want

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:36.170
a pitch meeting or i want you to read my script
i just want to get to know you because what

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:40.380
happens is if you actually invest a couple
of short calls doing that over a period of

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:47.129
weeks that prohibition against we don't deal
with strangers or we don't read unsolicited

00:03:47.129 --> 00:03:54.480
material vanishes it evaporates because now
you're not unknown that's a human metric and

00:03:54.480 --> 00:04:03.660
you can overcome that um i'll share a quick
story about many many years ago i always when

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:09.380
i have a project i always put together what
i call a top 100 list who are the people that

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:14.390
ideally in every category that i want to that
i would want to approach to talk about this

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:19.759
project from editors and writers and cinematographers
and casting directors to producers to buyers

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:26.559
studios streamers you name it and i will just
go through that list and prioritize them and

00:04:26.559 --> 00:04:30.669
i'll reach out to them and usually again it
may not be the name on the door or maybe it

00:04:30.669 --> 00:04:40.150
is um but the idea um the story that i want
to share is that years ago i i made a list

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:48.270
and um it wasn't arrogance it was just i'm
it was a dream so i added a name to my list

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:55.009
that was the most preeminent name in hollywood
at the time and probably still is steven spielberg

00:04:55.009 --> 00:04:59.640
so here i am a little guppy and i put the
name of steven spielberg on my list and i

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:06.360
think you know you know normally you would
think oh sober up child it's not going to

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:12.330
